      "about": "subject"
    },
    {
      "text": "This transformation is mathematically allowed by Jensen's inequality.",
      "sentence_ids": [
        548
      ],
      "about": "subject"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting lower bound on the objective function is called the Evidence Lower Bound (ELBO).",
      "sentence_ids": [
        555,
        556
      ],
      "about": "subject"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ELBO serves as a lower bound to the likelihood of the data under the model, which is the quantity of interest.",
